    narr:generatedFrom "3d701e5703aa3f959ba54d59603077ba4a8ce3db" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative maps [a four-tier pricing ladder](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_10) that runs from a free seeded interview through [Expert](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_10), [Team](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_10), and [Organization](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_10) tiers, framed as [behavioral steps rather than paywalls](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_11) — [the interview produces a perspective in a trial account](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_9), and [the user decides how far to take it](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_12). The second thread stress-tests that ladder against a real user: [Tess was classified as a Knowledge-Rich Consumer and Trigger-1 exemplar](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_34), but [the typology conflated AI-fluency with distribution-motion](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_39) — [her \"similar to Pat\" remark named her distribution motion](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_40), and [both are Knowledge Packagers, differing on other axes](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_41). The correction holds [three facts separately](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_47): [her Individual-tier placement is relational, not sales-validated](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_45) — [she doesn't validate Individual pricing](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_49), yet [doesn't invalidate Professional pricing either](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_50). Her actual role — [the single most prolific beta tester](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_54) — is [absent from the perspective today](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_51), prompting [a feedback-capture mechanism](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_72) and [a question about whether the typology itself needs fixing](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_78).""" ;
